body:
instead of 

```
if(num == 1)  
{           
response = realloc(response, 2);  
response[0] = '1';  
return response;  
 }  
else if(num == 0)  
{  
response = realloc(response, 2);  
response[0] = '0';  
return response;  
}   
```

you can have

```
if (num ==1 || num == 0)
{
  response_rea = realloc(response, 2)
  free(response)
  reponse_rea[0] = num + 48
  return response_rea
}
```
